{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04859","headline":"岳阳晚景 · 张均","name":"岳阳晚景","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚景寒鵶集，秋风旅鴈归。\n水光浮日出，霞彩暎江飞。\n洲白芦花吐，园红柿叶稀。\n长沙卑湿地，九月未成衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张均","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}